---
// Astro component script
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>João Tomás Garcia Farinha - Bridging Neuroscience &amp; Engineering</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="João Tomás Garcia Farinha — Portfolio of a PhD researcher in Computer Science, AI, EEG/fNIRS brain devices, signal processing, and full-stack multidisciplinary engineering.">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* --- DESIGN SYSTEM CSS START --- */
    
    /* (Perplexity Design System, pasted from instructions) */
    *, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    :root {
      --color-card-bg: #ffffff;
      --color-card-border: #e2e6fa;
      --color-input-bg: #f5f8ff;
      --color-cream-50: #fdfdfd;
      --color-slate-900: #1a1b26;
      --color-cream-100: #ffffff;
      --color-primary: #3B82F6;
      --color-primary-dark: #2760b8;
      --color-secondary: #8B5CF6;
      --color-background: var(--color-cream-50);
      --color-text: var(--color-slate-900);
      --color-surface: var(--color-cream-100);
      --color-border: rgba(94, 82, 64, 0.2);
      --radius-lg: 12px;
      --box-shadow: 0 2px 24px 0 rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.10);
      --box-shadow-card: 0 4px 12px 0 rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.05);
      --box-shadow-hover: 0 8px 24px rgba(59,130,246,.13);
      --font-family: 'Inter', 'FKGroteskNeue', 'Geist', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    [data-theme="dark"] {
      --color-primary: #60a5fa;
      --color-primary-dark: #3b82f6;
      --color-secondary: #a78bfa;
      --color-background: #0f172a;
      --color-text: #e2e8f0;
      --color-surface: #1e293b;
      --color-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      --box-shadow: 0 2px 24px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      --box-shadow-card: 0 4px 12px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      --box-shadow-hover: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
      --color-cream-50: #0f172a;
      --color-slate-900: #e2e8f0;
      --color-cream-100: #1e293b;
      --color-card-bg: #1e293b;
      --color-card-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      --color-input-bg: #334155;
    }


    html,body {
      font-family: var(--font-family);
      color: var(--color-text);
      background: var(--color-background);
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      min-height: 100%;
    }
    a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--color-primary); transition: color 0.2s; }
    a:hover, .btn:hover { color: var(--color-secondary); }
    h1,h3,h4,h5,h6 { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.75rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
    .container {
      max-width: 1080px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 1.1rem;
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box; 
    }
    .sr-only {
      position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); border: 0;
    }
    /* Skip link visual on focus */
    .skip { position: absolute; left: -9999px; top: 4px; background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; padding: 10px 25px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); z-index: 100; transition: left .2s; }
    .skip:focus { left: 16px; outline: 2px solid #fff; }
    /* --- HEADER + NAV --- */
    header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 30; background: var(--color-card-bg); box-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(196,206,241,0.09); transition: box-shadow .22s; }
    .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 72px; }
    .nav-logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-primary); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    nav ul { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
    .nav-link { color: var(--color-slate-900); font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.1rem; transition: color .18s; border: 0; background: none; padding: 0; cursor: pointer; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
    .nav-link:focus, .nav-link:hover { color: var(--color-primary); outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary); background: #f7f7fa; }
    .hamburger { display: none; background: none; border: none; padding: 8px; cursor: pointer; }
    .hamburger span {
      display: block; width: 30px; height: 3px; background: var(--color-primary); margin: 6px 0; border-radius: 2px; transition: all .23s;
    }
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      nav ul { position: absolute; top: 72px; right: 0; background:#fff; box-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgba(196,206,241,0.13); flex-direction: column; gap:0; width: 220px; height: auto; padding: 1rem 0; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); transform: translateY(-60px); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: .2s; }
      nav ul.show { transform: translateY(0); opacity:1; pointer-events: all; }
      .nav-link { display: block; padding: 12px 32px; border: none; margin: 3px 0; }
      .hamburger { display: block; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 380px) {
    .highlight-card {
      min-width: 140px;
    }
    .skill-card {
      min-width: 150px;
    }
  }

    /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6 10%, #8B5CF6 90%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 100px 0 70px 0;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-title { font-size: 2.3rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .hero-subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .hero-tagline { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-weight: 400; opacity: .88; }
    .hero-btns {
      display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn {
      padding: 12px 30px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-card); font-size: 1.06rem; background: var(--color-card-bg); color: var(--color-primary); border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all .19s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; outline: none; text-align: center; min-width: 130px;
    }
    .btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-primary); }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--color-secondary); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 2px 16px 0 #3b82f650; }
    .btn-secondary { background: var(--color-card-bg); border: 1.7px solid #fff; color: var(--color-primary); }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: #edf3ff; }
    /* --- ABOUT --- */
    .about-wrap { display: flex; gap: 2.3rem; align-items: flex-start; margin: 78px 0 54px 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .about-photo { flex: none; width: 148px; height: 148px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(127deg, #3B82F6 40%, #8B5CF6 90%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 7px 32px 0 #3B82F621; overflow: hidden; }
    .about-photo__img { width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-card-bg); }
    .about-content { flex: 1 1 330px; min-width: 220px; }
    .about-content h2 { text-align: left; margin-bottom: 13px; }
    .about-paragraph { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.62; font-weight: 400; }
    .about-highlights { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .highlight-card {
      background: var(--color-card-bg); color: #404368; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 1.01rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 170px; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px #3B82F61a;
      border: 1.5px solid #e2e6fa;
    }
    /* --- SKILLS --- */
    .skills-section { margin: 46px 0 54px 0; }
    .skills-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; margin-top: 18px; justify-content: center; }
    .skill-card {
      background: var(--color-card-bg); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: 0 1px 12px #3B82F609; padding: 18px 26px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; font-size: 1.09rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-primary); transition: transform .15s, box-shadow .18s; min-width: 190px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }
    .skill-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02); box-shadow: 0 6px 18px #3B82F649; }
    .skill-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--color-secondary); opacity: .76; }
    /* --- PROJECTS --- */
    .projects-section { margin: 42px 0 60px 0; }
    .projects-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 27px;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(295px, 1fr));
      margin-top: 25px;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .project-card {
      background: var(--color-card-bg); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-card); padding: 0 0 16px 0; transition: box-shadow .22s, transform .18s; position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .project-card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02); box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-hover); }
    .project-img {
      width: 100%; height: 148px; background: linear-gradient(123deg,#ccdbff 0,#8B5CF6 80%); border-radius: var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) 0 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 2.5rem; color: #fff;
    }
    .project-content { padding: 18px 20px 0 20px; flex: 1 1 auto; }
    .project-card h4 { font-size: 1.16rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin: 7px 0 4px 0; font-weight: 700; }
    .project-desc { color: #404368; font-size: .99rem; margin-bottom: 11px; }
    .project-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .project-tag { background: #f1f6fe; color: var(--color-secondary); font-size: 0.93rem; padding: 3px 11px; border-radius: 18px; font-weight: 520; }
    .project-status { font-size: 0.91rem; color: #777; margin-bottom: 4px; display: block; }
    .project-btn { margin-top: auto; padding: 7px 16px; font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 500; background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 7px; cursor: pointer; transition: background .15s; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px #3B82F617; }
    .project-btn:hover, .project-btn:focus { background: var(--color-secondary); outline: 2px solid var(--color-secondary); }
    /* --- TESTIMONIALS --- */
    .testimonials-section { margin: 42px 0 62px 0; }
    .testimonials-title { margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .testimonials-grid { display: grid; gap: 24px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); justify-content: center; }
    .testimonial { border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 28px 28px 18px 28px; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 1px 14px #3B82F609; background: var(--color-card-bg); }
    .testimonial-blue { background: #e8f0fe; }
    .testimonial-purple { background: #f7eefc; }
    .testimonial-green { background: #e9fcf4; }
    .testimonial-amber { background: #fff8ec; }
    .testimonial-quote {
      font-size: 1.13rem; color: #3b3b58; margin-bottom: 18px; font-style: italic;
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;
    }
    .quote-mark { font-size: 2.6rem; color: var(--color-secondary); line-height: 100%; opacity: .38; }
    .testimonial-author-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 6px; }
    .testimonial-logo {
      width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 100%; background: var(--color-card-bg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 1.5px 7px #3B82F618; font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    .testimonial-author-details { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .testimonial-author { font-size: 0.97rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); }
    .testimonial-position { font-size: 0.92rem; color: #421988; }
    .testimonial-institution { font-size: 0.89rem; color: #5c5d66; }
    /* --- ANIMATION: Testimonials fade in */
    .fade-in { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px) scale(.99); transition: opacity .6s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1), transform .6s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1); }
    .fade-in.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    /* --- PUBLICATIONS --- */
    .publications-section { margin: 41px 0 56px 0; }
    .pub-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
    .pub-item { background: var(--color-card-bg); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: 0 1px 7px #3B82F606; padding: 20px 28px 19px 28px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .pub-title { font-size: 1.17rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-secondary); }
    .pub-citation { color: #314267; font-size: 0.96rem; margin-top: 4px; }
    .pub-badge {
      background: #d1d9ff; color: #473fcf; font-size: .92rem; border-radius: 13px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 14px; margin-left: 7px; margin-top: 2px; vertical-align: middle;
    }
    /* --- CONTACT --- */
    .contact-section { margin: 21px 0 56px 0; }
    .contact-links { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 17px; justify-content: center; }
    .btn-social { background: var(--color-card-bg); color: var(--color-primary); border: 1.7px solid var(--color-primary); box-shadow: 0 1px 12px #3B82F609; padding: 13px 22px; border-radius: 11px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 1.09rem; transition: background .17s; }
    .btn-social:hover { background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; }
    .contact-form { background: var(--color-card-bg); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: 0 1.5px 10px #8B5CF618; padding: 24px 23px; max-width: 430px; width: 100%; margin-top: 22px; }
    .contact-flex { display: flex; gap: 20px; justify-content: center; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 19px; }
    .form-label { display: block; font-weight: 500; color: #453fa7; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.01rem; }
    .form-control { display: block; border: 1.4px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 6.5px; font-size: 1.07rem; padding: 12px 13px; width: 100%; font-family: inherit; background: var(--color-input-bg); transition: border .16s;box-sizing: border-box; }
    .form-control:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary); border-color: var(--color-primary); background: var(--color-card-bg); }
    .form-error { color: #db4545; font-size: .99rem; margin-top: 2px; min-height: 18px; display: block; }
    .submit-btn { width: 100%; margin-top: 7px; }
    @media(max-width: 650px){
      .about-wrap { flex-direction: column; gap: 36px; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
      .about-photo { align-self: center; }
      .about-content h2 { text-align: center; }
      .about-highlights { justify-content: center; }
      .contact-flex { flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
      .contact-form { margin-left: 0; }
      .skills-list,.contact-links { flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items:stretch; }
    }
    /* --- FOOTER --- */
    footer {
      background: var(--color-surface); padding: 23px 0; border-top: 1.5px solid #eaeaf3; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-direction: column; font-size: .99em; color: #444872; margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .footer-flex { display: flex; gap: 32px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .footer-social { display: flex; gap: 18px; }
    .footer-link { color: #464bf0; font-weight: 500; transition: color .17s; }
    .footer-link:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }
    /* --- FOCUS STYLES for accessibility --- */
    button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible, .form-control:focus-visible {
      outline: 2.5px solid var(--color-secondary); outline-offset: 1px;
    }
    
    /* DARK MODE */
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      .hero { background: linear-gradient(128deg,#312e81 10%, #4338ca 83%); }
      body, html { background: #151730; color: #cbdff9; }
      .about-photo { background: linear-gradient(124deg, #262959 28%, #8B5CF6 92%); }
      .about-content, .about-content h2, .about-content p, .about-highlights { color: #eef4ff; }
      .highlight-card, .skill-card, .project-card, .contact-form, .pub-item { background: #22254b; color: #e2ecf7; border-color: #3b82f625; }
      .project-img { background: linear-gradient(123deg,#2d2763 0,#5d48ba 90%); }
      .btn, .btn-social { background: #25295b; color: #f0f7ff; border-color: #3B82F6 }
      .btn-primary { background: #4338ca; color: #fff; }
      .btn-secondary { background: #22254b; color: #9dbdff; }
      .footer-link, .footer-flex { color: #c5cdfa; }
      footer { background: #131424; border-top: 1.5px solid #262959; color: #93b0e5; }
    }
    .theme-toggle { position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 20px; background: none; border: 2px solid var(--color-primary); color: var(--color-primary); border-radius: 50%; width: 40px; height: 40px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.2rem; transition: all 0.2s; z-index: 1000; }
    .theme-toggle:hover { background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; }
  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
  <button id="themeToggle" class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Dark Mode">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i>
  </button>
  <!-- Survey Banner -->
<div id="survey-banner" style="background-color:#3B82F6; color:white; text-align:center; padding:0.5em 1em; font-weight:600; font-family:'Inter', sans-serif; position:relative;">
  <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfbh9Eh_44jXly5K_m0NjDWFKz71nsHbqO9lZ7qe9Hmy9sHQQ/viewform?usp=dialog" target="_blank" style="color:white; text-decoration:underline;">
    Help shape the future: Take a quick survey!
  </a>
  <button onclick="document.getElementById('survey-banner').style.display='none';" aria-label="Close survey banner" style="position:absolute; right:10px; top:5px; background:none; border:none; color:white; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer; font-size:1.2em;">&times;</button>
</div>

  <a href="#main-content" class="skip">Skip to main content</a>
  <!-- HEADER & NAVIGATION -->
  <header>
    <div class="container nav" role="navigation" aria-label="Primary">
      <span class="nav-logo" tabindex="0">João Farinha</span>
      <button class="hamburger" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-expanded="false" id="menuBtn">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
      <nav aria-label="Main">
        <ul id="navLinks">
          <li><a href="#about" class="nav-link" aria-label="About">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="#skills" class="nav-link" aria-label="Skills">Skills</a></li>
          <li><a href="#projects" class="nav-link" aria-label="Projects">Projects</a></li>
          <li><a href="#testimonials" class="nav-link" aria-label="Testimonials">Testimonials</a></li>
          <li><a href="#publications" class="nav-link" aria-label="Publications">Publications</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-link" aria-label="Contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="hero" id="hero" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="container" >
      <h1 class="hero-title">João Garcia Farinha — Bridging Neuroscience &amp; Systems Engineering</h1>
      <div class="hero-subtitle">PhD Researcher in Multimodal Brain-Computer Interfaces (BCI) | Hardware Hacker | AI Scientist</div>
      <div class="hero-btns" style="margin-bottom:3px;">
        <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary" aria-label="View Projects">View Projects <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></a>
        <a href="/about_me/main.pdf" class="btn btn-secondary" aria-label="Download CV" download>Download CV <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i></a>
        <a href="#publications" class="btn btn-secondary" aria-label="Read Publications">Read Publications <i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
    <section id="about" class="container" aria-label="About section">
      <div class="about-wrap">
        <div class="about-photo" aria-label="João's photo"><div class="about-photo__img"></div></div>
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>About Me</h2>
          <div class="about-paragraph">I am a multidisciplinary R&amp;D engineer and PhD researcher at LASIGE (Universidade de Lisboa) specializing in Brain-Computer Interfaces (BCI) and multimodal machine learning. My background spans Meteorology, Geophysics, and Informatics, giving me a unique mathematical approach to modeling complex, non-stationary physical systems. Currently, my research focuses on solving the 'generalization crisis' in neurotechnology. Instead of treating physiological fluctuations (like eye movements, heart rate, and metabolic states like glucose spikes) as noise, my architectures use a Learning Using Privileged Information (LUPI) framework to treat them as predictive context. By fusing high-density EEG and fNIRS with custom hardware and embedded AI, I am building robust, calibration-free assistive technologies that can transition from controlled labs into the chaotic real world.</div>
          <div class="about-highlights">
            <div class="highlight-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask skill-icon"></i>PhD in EE/CS <span style="font-size:.96em;opacity:.7;">(EEG Devices)</span></div>
            <div class="highlight-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb skill-icon"></i>Patented Inventor</div>
            <div class="highlight-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group skill-icon"></i>Multidisciplinary Background</div>
            <div class="highlight-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-sitemap skill-icon"></i>Full-Stack Engineering</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- SKILLS SECTION -->
    <section id="skills" class="container skills-section" aria-label="Skills section">
      <h2>Skills &amp; Tech Stack</h2>
      <div class="skills-list">
        <div class="skill-card" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;min-width:240px;flex:1;">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-wave-square skill-icon"></i><strong>Neuroscience &amp; Signals</strong></div>
          <span style="font-size:0.9rem;color:#404368;">BCI, EEG/fNIRS Processing, Lab Streaming Layer (LSL), BIDS standards, Signal Fusion</span>
        </div>
